WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400 line:85%
Open LEVEL UP and tap START. No account is needed.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.437 line:85%
The System welcomes you and gives you your first quest.

3
00:00:07.487 --> 00:00:10.637 line:85%
TODAY shows your Daily Quest: small tasks that reset every day.

4
00:00:10.687 --> 00:00:18.823 line:85%
Do the task for real, then tap COMPLETE to earn XP.

5
00:00:18.873 --> 00:00:20.856 line:85%
Tap + to add your own goal.

6
00:00:20.906 --> 00:00:27.711 line:85%
Name it, pick an icon and how hard it is, then save. Daily quests unlock as you level up.

7
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.195 line:85%
Your quests and goals live in QUESTS.

8
00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:39.121 line:85%
Tap the timer to time your focus. Real work time is saved.

9
00:00:39.171 --> 00:00:44.454 line:85%
Done? Tap COMPLETE. Harder goals give more XP.

10
00:00:44.504 --> 00:00:54.699 line:85%
Fill the XP bar to LEVEL UP. Each level brings rewards and opens new parts of the app.

11
00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:59.469 line:85%
PROGRESS: your hero, the level road with its rewards, and your stats.

12
00:00:59.519 --> 00:01:03.927 line:85%
MORE: Learn & Grow, Clan, Budget, this Guide and Settings.

13
00:01:03.977 --> 00:01:07.835 line:85%
Watch this video and replay the tour any time in MORE → GUIDE.

14
00:01:07.885 --> 00:01:11.037 line:85%
That is all. Now it is your turn. Good luck, Hero!
